<title>USA: TENNIS-CARLSBAD WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CARLSBAD WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, California 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Toshiba Classic women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>2-Monica Seles (U.S) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>3-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Anne-Gaelle Sidot</p>
<p>(France) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) beat 4-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario</p>
<p>(Spain) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat 5-Anke Huber (Germany) 6-2 2-6</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>6-Mary Pierce (France) beat Nathalie Tauziat (France) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>7-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S) 6-3 3-6</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat 8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) 6-2</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Late match:</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Venus Williams (U.S.)</p>
</text>
